1340
00:59:21.640 --> 00:59:23.435
that you must be involved somehow.

1341
00:59:23.520 --> 00:59:27.639
I'm afraid I have no choice
but to fire you.

1342
00:59:28.800 --> 00:59:31.235
You have a thousand other choices.

1343
00:59:31.320 --> 00:59:32.310
I guess that's true.

1344
00:59:32.400 --> 00:59:33.993
I probably do have
a few other choices, don't I?

1345
00:59:35.280 --> 00:59:37.555
Well, the one I'm going with
is "fire you."

1346
00:59:37.640 --> 00:59:40.470
All right, everyone, pack up all of
your things while we call your parents.

1347
00:59:40.560 --> 00:59:43.029
And, Mr. Teller,
good luck finding another job.

1348
00:59:43.120 --> 00:59:44.873
Without my recommendation, I'm afraid.

1349
00:59:46.040 --> 00:59:48.635
I'm tired of that guy busting my balls.

1350
00:59:48.720 --> 00:59:52.075
Yes, hello. I was thinking
