Yeah, it was, um...

1506
01:08:22.400 --> 01:08:24.392
It was a total crapstorm of a day.

1507
01:08:24.480 --> 01:08:26.392
Yeah, I know.

1508
01:08:26.480 --> 01:08:28.790
But this was awesome.

1509
01:08:28.880 --> 01:08:30.675
I kind of figured it was you all along.

1510
01:08:30.760 --> 01:08:34.151
But then, I confirmed it
when I watched this.

1511
01:08:38.680 --> 01:08:40.399
And what is that?

1512
01:08:41.160 --> 01:08:43.115
A VHS tape.

1513
01:08:43.200 --> 01:08:44.395
It's vintage.

1514
01:08:44.480 --> 01:08:46.790
Basically, it's like a box
that's full of an archaic system

1515
01:08:46.880 --> 01:08:49.235
